    t\u1EAFc c\u1EE7a vai m\xECnh."
  tripped: "C\u1EA7u dao nh\u1EA3y! B\u1EADt qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u c\xF4ng t\u1EAFc c\xF9ng
