    c\xE1c \u0111\xE8n c\xF3 ch\u1EA5m xanh."
  notOwner: "C\xF4ng t\u1EAFc n\xE0y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i c\u1EE7a vai b\u1EA1n \u0111ang
